    {
      "id": 264688,
      "name": "",
      "username": "LonelyMan",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/l/f4b2a3/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2025-12-18T22:15:34.500Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The definitive edition was made with Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth and love, unlike Spirit Island, which initially was not made with both of those things in mind.</p>\n<p>“A little spicy, this one!”  It was a Trodcullon…</p>\n<p>The Vruciads at least are probably older than OblivAeon.  Maybe also the Satellans, and a ton of pre-spaceflight, probably pre-sapient races that are now extinct or Endlinged by virtue of Orbo eating them.</p>\n<p>Aeon Girl versus the Progenies…“Many interesting effects.”  Like the polarizing power of electricity.</p>\n<p>Santabear!  Am I the only one yelling that at my screen during the last letter?  I even had a Santabear as a kid, and C&amp;A are similar in age to myself, I would think they had to have seen a display in the windows of a department store when they were 5 or something.</p>\n<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"TakeWalker\" data-post=\"3\" data-topic=\"28501\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/48/5677_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TakeWalker:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That Il Alimento theme drop, though. XD</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Lol trolled…m  (See also McBehr’s preferred name.)</p>",
      "post_number": 14,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2025-12-18T23:08:58.633Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": 3,
      "quote_count": 1,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 6,
      "readers_count": 5,
      "score": 16.2,
      "yours": false,
      "topic_id": 28501,
      "topic_slug": "editor-s-note-46",
      "display_username": "",
      "primary_group_name": null,
      "flair_name": null,
      "flair_url": null,
      "flair_bg_color": null,
      "flair_color": null,
      "flair_group_id": null,
      "badges_granted": [],
      "version": 6,
      "can_edit": false,
      "can_delete": false,
      "can_recover": false,
      "can_see_hidden_post": false,
      "can_wiki": false,
      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "The definitive edition was made with Polish-Lithuanian Commonwealth and love, unlike Spirit Island, which initially was not made with both of those things in mind.\n\n\"A little spicy, this one!\"  It was a Trodcullon....\n\nThe Vruciads at least are probably older than OblivAeon.  Maybe also the Satellans, and a ton of pre-spaceflight, probably pre-sapient races that are now extinct or Endlinged by virtue of Orbo eating them.\n\nAeon Girl versus the Progenies...\"Many interesting effects.\"  Like the polarizing power of electricity.\n\nSantabear!  Am I the only one yelling that at my screen during the last letter?  I even had a Santabear as a kid, and C&A are similar in age to myself, I would think they had to have seen a display in the windows of a department store when they were 5 or something.\n\n[quote=\"TakeWalker, post:3, topic:28501\"]\nThat Il Alimento theme drop, though. XD\n[/quote]\n\nLol trolled...m  (See also McBehr's preferred name.)",
